  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Time; <strong>CL</strong> 3rd<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 3,600 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 3 lbs.</p>\n<p>This scabbard automatically reshapes itself to fit any weapon that the wearer attempts to fit into it. Twice per day, as a free action, the wearer can press a button to accelerate the weapon out of the sheath and draw the weapon as part of making an attack with it. This can be used with splash weapons, but not with non-weapons like potions and spell engines.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Marvelous Item, Time sphere, Quick Draw feat or Equipment (Fast Draw) talent; <strong>Cost</strong> 1,800 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/marvelous-items#toc67\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
